entries[178341] = { ["name"] = "Rising Sun Kick", ["text"] = "2 Chi Melee Range\nInstant 10 sec cooldown\n1 Charge\nRequires Crane Stance, Ox Stance, Tiger Stance\nYou kick upwards, dealing [10.56 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Min DPS + (Offhand Min DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 - 1))] to [10.56 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Max DPS + (Offhand Max DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 + 1))] damage [ Combat Conditioning : reducing the effectiveness of healing on the target for 10 sec ] and causing all enemies within 0 yards to take 1% increased damage from your abilities for until canceled." }
entries[178342] = { ["name"] = "Spinning Crane Kick", ["text"] = "8.8% of base mana / 40 Energy\nChanneled (2.25 sec cast)\nRequires Crane Stance, Serpent Stance, Ox Stance, Tiger Stance\nWindwalker, Mistweaver\nYou spin while kicking in the air, dealing [(4 * 0.9 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Min DPS + (Offhand Min DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 - 1)) + 4 * 0.9 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Max DPS + (Offhand Max DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 + 1))) / 2] damage over 2.3 sec to enemies within 8 yards Generates 0 Chi if it strikes 3 or more targets.\n\nBrewmaster\nYou spin while kicking in the air, dealing [(4 * 0.9 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Min DPS + (Offhand Min DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 - 1)) + 4 * 0.9 * ( (1.0 * (1 + Versatility)) * (0.857143 * (Mainhand Max DPS + (Offhand Max DPS / 2)) + Attack Power / 3.5 + 1))) / 2] damage over 2.3 sec to enemies within 8 yards Generates 0 Chi if it strikes 3 or more targets.\n\nChanneling Spinning Crane Kick does not prevent avoiding attacks." }
